{"id":"011da0e43375586d37268216d61174b345cfcf92","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"011da0e43375586d37268216d61174b345cfcf92","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/v3/schema_validation.proto","lines":["@@ -29,8 +29,8 @@ message SchemaValidation {","   // ``envoy.ai.llm_protocol.request`` filter state object or the route's :ref:`llm_protocol","   // <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.RequestPerRoute.llm_protocol>`.","   // ``LLM_PROTOCOL_UNSPECIFIED``, the default, detects it from the request path, then the","-  // ``anthropic-version`` header, then the payload's shape. A request none of them identifies is","-  // forwarded unvalidated.","+  // payload's shape together with the ``anthropic-version`` header. A request they do not identify","+  // is forwarded unvalidated.","   type.ai.v3.LLMProtocol default_llm_protocol = 1 [(validate.rules).enum = {defined_only: true}];"," ","   // Forward a payload that violates its schema instead of rejecting it. It is still counted."],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"changelogs/current/bug_fixes/ai_protocol_manager__llm-detection-neighbor-endpoints.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@","+Fixed the ``schema_validation`` AI filter detecting requests to a provider's other endpoints as a","+chat API: ``/v1/messages/count_tokens`` requests were rejected with a ``400``, and embeddings","+requests were treated as OpenAI Responses calls. :ref:`API detection","+<config_http_ai_filters_schema_validation_detection>` describes the rules."],"additions":4,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/schema_validation_filter.rst","lines":["@@ -37,17 +37,60 @@ The payload is validated against the API the request declares: the"," <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.RequestPerRoute.llm_protocol>`."," A request that declares none falls back to :ref:`default_llm_protocol"," <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.http.ai_filters.schema_validation.v3.SchemaValidation.default_llm_protocol>`,","-and by default the API is detected from the request: its path, matched as a","-suffix against each provider's REST path (``/chat/completions``,","-``/responses``, ``/v1/messages``, ``:generateContent``,","-``:streamGenerateContent``); then the ``anthropic-version`` header; then the","-payload's shape.","-","-Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages share the ``messages[]`` request","-shape, so only keys exclusive to one of them tell the two apart. A payload","-carrying markers of both, or of neither -- including","-``{\"model\": ..., \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": ...}]}``, which is","-valid under either -- names no API, and is forwarded unvalidated.","+and when that is unset too, the API is detected from the request.","+","+.. _config_http_ai_filters_schema_validation_detection:","+","+API detection","+-------------","+","+The path decides, and the payload only when the path names no API. The first","+row that matches wins:","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: The request, Detected API","+  :widths: 3, 1","+","+  \"Path ends with ``/chat/completions``\", ``OPENAI_CHAT_COMPLETIONS``","+  \"Path ends with ``/responses``\", ``OPENAI_RESPONSES``","+  \"Path ends with ``/v1/messages``\", ``ANTHROPIC_MESSAGES``","+  \"Path ends with ``:generateContent`` or ``:streamGenerateContent``\", ``GEMINI_GENERATE_CONTENT``","+  \"Path goes on after one of the first three, as in ``/v1/messages/count_tokens``\", None","+  \"Payload has Gemini markers, but the path ends with another method, as in ``:countTokens``\", None","+  \"Payload has Gemini markers\", ``GEMINI_GENERATE_CONTENT``","+  \"Payload has ``messages`` and only Chat Completions markers\", ``OPENAI_CHAT_COMPLETIONS``","+  \"Payload has ``messages``, ``max_tokens`` and only Anthropic markers\", ``ANTHROPIC_MESSAGES``","+  Anything else, None","+","+The path is matched without its query and as a suffix, so a gateway prefix such","+as ``/anthropic/v1/messages`` does not hide it.","+","+Markers are what only one API has:","+","+* Gemini: ``contents``, ``systemInstruction`` or ``generationConfig``, the last","+  two in either camel or snake case.","+* Chat Completions: ``max_completion_tokens``, ``response_format``,","+  ``frequency_penalty``, ``presence_penalty``, ``stream_options``,","+  ``logit_bias``, a tool with ``function``, or a message whose role is","+  ``system``, ``developer`` or ``tool``.","+* Anthropic: ``system``, ``stop_sequences``, ``top_k``, ``thinking``, a tool","+  with ``input_schema``, or an ``anthropic-version`` request header.","+","+A wrong guess rejects a valid request, so detection gives up when unsure:","+","+* Markers of both APIs, or of neither, detect nothing. That includes","+  ``{\"model\": ..., \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": ...}]}``, which is","+  valid under both.","+* Without ``messages`` in the payload, an ``anthropic-version`` header detects","+  nothing, because Anthropic clients send it to every endpoint.","+* Anthropic Messages needs ``max_tokens``, which that API requires and a","+  token-counting request does not carry.","+* The Responses API is detected by its path only, because","+  ``{\"model\": ..., \"input\": ...}`` is also an embeddings request.","+","+A request whose API is not detected is forwarded unvalidated and counted as","+``skipped``. Name its API on the route or with ``default_llm_protocol`` to","+validate it."," "," Statistics"," ----------"],"additions":54,"deletions":11,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/filter.cc","lines":["@@ -65,10 +65,7 @@ LLMProtocol SchemaValidationFilter::resolveLlmProtocol(const AiRequest& request)","   if (config_->defaultLlmProtocol() != LLMProtocol::Unspecified) {","     return config_->defaultLlmProtocol();","   }","-  LLMProtocol detected = detectFromHeaders(context_.request_headers);","-  if (detected == LLMProtocol::Unspecified) {","-    detected = detectFromPayload(request.json());","-  }","+  const LLMProtocol detected = detectLlmProtocol(context_.request_headers, request.json());","   if (detected != LLMProtocol::Unspecified) {","     config_->stats().llm_protocol_detected_.inc();","   }"],"additions":1,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/llm_protocol_detection.cc","lines":["@@ -53,9 +53,21 @@ bool hasOpenAiOnlyRole(const nlohmann::json& messages) {","          });"," }"," ","+// `/v1/messages/count_tokens` and the like take a body shaped like the API they sit under.","+bool isApiSubResource(absl::string_view path) {","+  static constexpr absl::string_view ApiPaths[]{\"/chat/completions/\", \"/responses/\",","+                                                \"/v1/messages/\"};","+  return absl::c_any_of(","+      ApiPaths, [path](absl::string_view api_path) { return absl::StrContains(path, api_path); });","+}","+","+bool endsInMethod(absl::string_view path) {","+  return absl::StrContains(path.substr(path.rfind('/') + 1), ':');","+}","+"," } // namespace"," ","-LLMProtocol detectFromHeaders(const Http::RequestHeaderMap& headers) {","+LLMProtocol detectLlmProtocol(const Http::RequestHeaderMap& headers, const nlohmann::json& json) {","   struct PathSuffix {","     absl::string_view suffix;","     LLMProtocol protocol;","@@ -74,28 +86,31 @@ LLMProtocol detectFromHeaders(const Http::RequestHeaderMap& headers) {","       return protocol;","     }","   }","-  return headers.get(anthropicVersionHeader()).empty() ? LLMProtocol::Unspecified","-                                                       : LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages;","-}","-","-LLMProtocol detectFromPayload(const nlohmann::json& json) {","-  if (!json.is_object()) {","+  if (!json.is_object() || isApiSubResource(path)) {","     return LLMProtocol::Unspecified;","   }","   if (hasAnyKey(json, GeminiOnlyKeys)) {","-    return LLMProtocol::GeminiGenerateContent;","+    // `:countTokens` and Gemini's other methods take `contents` too.","+    return endsInMethod(path) ? LLMProtocol::Unspecified : LLMProtocol::GeminiGenerateContent;","   }","+  // `input` alone is `/v1/embeddings` or `/v1/moderations` as much as the Responses API.","   const auto messages = json.find(Keys::Messages);","   if (messages == json.end()) {","-    return json.contains(Keys::Input) ? LLMProtocol::OpenAiResponses : LLMProtocol::Unspecified;","+    return LLMProtocol::Unspecified;","   }","-  const bool anthropic = hasAnyKey(json, AnthropicOnlyKeys) || anyToolHas(json, \"input_schema\");","+  // Anthropic clients send the header to every endpoint, so it counts only beside `messages`.","+  const bool anthropic = hasAnyKey(json, AnthropicOnlyKeys) || anyToolHas(json, \"input_schema\") ||","+                         !headers.get(anthropicVersionHeader()).empty();","   const bool openai = hasAnyKey(json, OpenAiOnlyKeys) || anyToolHas(json, \"function\") ||","                       hasOpenAiOnlyRole(*messages);","   if (anthropic == openai) {","     return LLMProtocol::Unspecified;","   }","-  return anthropic ? LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages : LLMProtocol::OpenAiChatCompletions;","+  if (openai) {","+    return LLMProtocol::OpenAiChatCompletions;","+  }","+  // Messages requires `max_tokens`, which the token-counting endpoints shaped like it do not take.","+  return json.contains(Keys::MaxTokens) ? LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages : LLMProtocol::Unspecified;"," }"," "," } // namespace SchemaValidation"],"additions":26,"deletions":11,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/llm_protocol_detection.h","lines":["@@ -11,14 +11,12 @@ namespace Extensions {"," namespace AiFilters {"," namespace SchemaValidation {"," ","-// The API a request's path names, matched as a suffix so a gateway prefix does not hide it, then","-// the `anthropic-version` header.","-HttpFilters::AiProtocolManager::LLMProtocol","-detectFromHeaders(const Http::RequestHeaderMap& headers);","-","-// The API a payload's shape names. Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages share `messages[]`, so","-// markers of both, or of neither, detect nothing.","-HttpFilters::AiProtocolManager::LLMProtocol detectFromPayload(const nlohmann::json& json);","+// The API a request's path names, matched as a suffix so a gateway prefix does not hide it, else","+// the one its payload's shape names. Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages share `messages[]`,","+// so markers of both, or of neither, detect nothing. Nor does a path that names another endpoint","+// of a provider, such as `/v1/messages/count_tokens`, whatever its payload.","+HttpFilters::AiProtocolManager::LLMProtocol detectLlmProtocol(const Http::RequestHeaderMap& headers,","+                                                              const nlohmann::json& json);"," "," } // namespace SchemaValidation"," } // namespace AiFilters"],"additions":6,"deletions":8,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/filter_test.cc","lines":["@@ -68,8 +68,8 @@ class SchemaValidationFilterTest : public testing::Test {"," ","   void run(JsonWithExtBuf doc, LLMProtocol declared_protocol,","            absl::string_view path = \"/v1/chat/completions\") {","-    request_headers_ =","-        Http::TestRequestHeaderMapImpl{{\":method\", \"POST\"}, {\":path\", std::string(path)}};","+    request_headers_.setMethod(\"POST\");","+    request_headers_.setPath(path);","     envoy::extensions::http::ai_filters::schema_validation::v3::SchemaValidation proto;","     proto.set_default_llm_protocol(default_llm_protocol_);","     proto.set_fail_open(fail_open_);","@@ -216,6 +216,27 @@ TEST_F(SchemaValidationFilterTest, UndetectedApiIsForwardedUnvalidated) {","   EXPECT_EQ(counterValue(\"skipped\"), 1);"," }"," ","+// Anthropic clients send the header to every endpoint, and this one takes a Messages-shaped body","+// without the `max_tokens` that schema requires.","+TEST_F(SchemaValidationFilterTest, CountTokensIsNotDetectedAsMessages) {","+  request_headers_.addCopy(\"anthropic-version\", \"2023-06-01\");","+  run(R\"({\"model\":\"claude\",\"system\":\"be terse\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}]})\",","+      LLMProtocol::Unspecified, \"/v1/messages/count_tokens\");","+  expectForwarded();","+  EXPECT_EQ(seen_protocol_, LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(counterValue(\"llm_protocol_detected\"), 0);","+  EXPECT_EQ(counterValue(\"skipped\"), 1);","+}","+","+TEST_F(SchemaValidationFilterTest, EmbeddingsIsNotDetectedAsResponses) {","+  run(R\"({\"model\":\"text-embedding-3-small\",\"input\":\"hi\"})\", LLMProtocol::Unspecified,","+      \"/v1/embeddings\");","+  expectForwarded();","+  EXPECT_EQ(seen_protocol_, LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(counterValue(\"llm_protocol_detected\"), 0);","+  EXPECT_EQ(counterValue(\"skipped\"), 1);","+}","+"," // Neither the default nor detection second-guesses a declared API."," TEST_F(SchemaValidationFilterTest, DeclaredApiOutranksDefaultAndDetection) {","   default_llm_protocol_ = envoy::type::ai::v3::ANTHROPIC_MESSAGES;"],"additions":23,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/llm_protocol_detection_test.cc","lines":["@@ -15,19 +15,29 @@ namespace {"," "," using HttpFilters::AiProtocolManager::LLMProtocol;"," ","-LLMProtocol fromPath(const std::string& path) {","-  return detectFromHeaders(Http::TestRequestHeaderMapImpl{{\":path\", path}});","-}","+constexpr absl::string_view EitherChatApiPayload =","+    R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"max_tokens\":8,\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}]})\";"," ","-LLMProtocol fromPayload(const std::string& json) {","-  return detectFromPayload(nlohmann::json::parse(json));","+LLMProtocol detect(absl::string_view path, absl::string_view payload,","+                   bool anthropic_version = false) {","+  Http::TestRequestHeaderMapImpl headers{{\":path\", std::string(path)}};","+  if (anthropic_version) {","+    headers.addCopy(\"anthropic-version\", \"2023-06-01\");","+  }","+  return detectLlmProtocol(headers, nlohmann::json::parse(payload));"," }"," ","-TEST(DetectFromHeadersTest, MatchesProviderPathSuffix) {","+LLMProtocol fromPath(const std::string& path) { return detect(path, \"{}\"); }","+","+LLMProtocol fromPayload(const std::string& json) { return detect(\"/generate\", json); }","+","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, MatchesProviderPathSuffix) {","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/v1/chat/completions\"), LLMProtocol::OpenAiChatCompletions);","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/openai/v1/chat/completions?trace=1\"), LLMProtocol::OpenAiChatCompletions);","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/v1/responses\"), LLMProtocol::OpenAiResponses);","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/proxy/v1/messages\"), LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages);","+  EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/v1/messages\"), LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages);","+  EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/v1/messages?beta=true\"), LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages);","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-pro:generateContent\"),","             LLMProtocol::GeminiGenerateContent);","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-pro:streamGenerateContent?alt=sse\"),","@@ -36,24 +46,88 @@ TEST(DetectFromHeadersTest, MatchesProviderPathSuffix) {","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPath(\"/\"), LLMProtocol::Unspecified);"," }"," ","-TEST(DetectFromHeadersTest, PathWinsOverTheAnthropicVersionHeader) {","-  EXPECT_EQ(detectFromHeaders(Http::TestRequestHeaderMapImpl{{\":path\", \"/generate\"},","-                                                             {\"anthropic-version\", \"2023-06-01\"}}),","+// `/v1/messages/count_tokens` takes a Messages body without the `max_tokens` that API requires.","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, PathUnderAnApiPathDetectsNothing) {","+  for (const absl::string_view path : {","+           \"/v1/messages/count_tokens\",","+           \"/anthropic/v1/messages/count_tokens?beta=true\",","+           \"/v1/messages/batches\",","+           \"/anthropic/v1/messages/batches\",","+           \"/v1/responses/input_tokens\",","+           \"/v1/chat/completions/chatcmpl-1\",","+       }) {","+    for (const absl::string_view payload : {","+             R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"system\":\"be terse\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}]})\",","+             R\"({\"requests\":[]})\",","+             R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"input\":\"hi\"})\",","+             R\"({\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":\"be terse\"}]})\",","+             R\"({\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"hi\"}]}]})\",","+         }) {","+      for (const bool anthropic_version : {false, true}) {","+        EXPECT_EQ(detect(path, payload, anthropic_version), LLMProtocol::Unspecified)","+            << path << \" \" << payload << \" anthropic-version: \" << anthropic_version;","+      }","+    }","+  }","+}","+","+// `:rawPredict` is how Vertex AI serves Claude, so another method discounts Gemini's keys only.","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, GeminiPayloadOnAnotherMethodDetectsNothing) {","+  constexpr absl::string_view payload = R\"({\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"hi\"}]}]})\";","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/generate\", payload), LLMProtocol::GeminiGenerateContent);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-pro:countTokens\", payload), LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/v1/publishers/anthropic/models/claude:rawPredict\",","+                   R\"({\"max_tokens\":8,\"system\":\"be terse\",\"messages\":[]})\"),","             LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages);","-  EXPECT_EQ(detectFromHeaders(Http::TestRequestHeaderMapImpl{{\":path\", \"/v1/chat/completions\"},","-                                                             {\"anthropic-version\", \"2023-06-01\"}}),","+}","+","+// Messages requires `max_tokens`. Token counting takes the same body without it, and for Claude","+// on Vertex AI the path names no API.","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, MessagesPayloadWithoutMaxTokensDetectsNothing) {","+  constexpr absl::string_view payload =","+      R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"system\":\"be terse\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}]})\";","+  for (const absl::string_view path : {","+           \"/v1/projects/p/locations/us-east5/publishers/anthropic/models/count-tokens:rawPredict\",","+           \"/generate\",","+       }) {","+    for (const bool anthropic_version : {false, true}) {","+      EXPECT_EQ(detect(path, payload, anthropic_version), LLMProtocol::Unspecified)","+          << path << \" anthropic-version: \" << anthropic_version;","+    }","+  }","+}","+","+// Anthropic clients send the header to every endpoint, so it names the provider, not the API.","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, AnthropicVersionHeaderOnlyBreaksATie) {","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/generate\", EitherChatApiPayload), LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/generate\", EitherChatApiPayload, true), LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/generate\", R\"({\"prompt\":\"hi\"})\", true), LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/v1/complete\", R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"prompt\":\"hi\",\"max_tokens_to_sample\":8})\", true),","+            LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/generate\", R\"({\"messages\":[],\"response_format\":{}})\", true),","+            LLMProtocol::Unspecified);","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/v1/chat/completions\", EitherChatApiPayload, true),","             LLMProtocol::OpenAiChatCompletions);"," }"," ","-TEST(DetectFromPayloadTest, ExclusiveMarkers) {","+// `/v1/embeddings`, `/v1/moderations` and `/v1/audio/speech` take a `model` and an `input` too.","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, ResponsesIsDetectedByPathOnly) {","+  constexpr absl::string_view payload = R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"input\":\"hi\"})\";","+  EXPECT_EQ(detect(\"/v1/responses\", payload), LLMProtocol::OpenAiResponses);","+  for (const absl::string_view path :","+       {\"/v1/embeddings\", \"/v1/moderations\", \"/v1/audio/speech\", \"/generate\"}) {","+    EXPECT_EQ(detect(path, payload), LLMProtocol::Unspecified) << path;","+  }","+}","+","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, ExclusivePayloadMarkers) {","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPayload(R\"({\"contents\":[{\"parts\":[{\"text\":\"hi\"}]}]})\"),","             LLMProtocol::GeminiGenerateContent);","   EXPECT_EQ(fromPayload(R\"({\"system_instruction\":{}})\"), LLMProtocol::GeminiGenerateContent);","-  EXPECT_EQ(fromPayload(R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"input\":\"hi\"})\"), LLMProtocol::OpenAiResponses);","   for (const std::string body : {","-           R\"({\"messages\":[],\"system\":\"be terse\"})\",","-           R\"({\"messages\":[],\"top_k\":5})\",","-           R\"({\"messages\":[],\"tools\":[{\"name\":\"t\",\"input_schema\":{}}]})\",","+           R\"({\"max_tokens\":8,\"messages\":[],\"system\":\"be terse\"})\",","+           R\"({\"max_tokens\":8,\"messages\":[],\"top_k\":5})\",","+           R\"({\"max_tokens\":8,\"messages\":[],\"tools\":[{\"name\":\"t\",\"input_schema\":{}}]})\",","        }) {","     EXPECT_EQ(fromPayload(body), LLMProtocol::AnthropicMessages) << body;","   }","@@ -66,7 +140,7 @@ TEST(DetectFromPayloadTest, ExclusiveMarkers) {","   }"," }"," ","-TEST(DetectFromPayloadTest, AmbiguousOrForeignDetectsNothing) {","+TEST(DetectLlmProtocolTest, AmbiguousOrForeignPayloadDetectsNothing) {","   for (const std::string body : {","            R\"({\"model\":\"m\",\"max_tokens\":8,\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}]})\",","            R\"({\"messages\":[],\"top_k\":5,\"response_format\":{}})\","],"additions":91,"deletions":17,"truncated":false},{"path":"test/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/schema_validation_integration_test.cc","lines":["@@ -130,6 +130,18 @@ TEST_P(SchemaValidationIntegrationTest, UnconfiguredRouteRejectsADetectedApiViol","   expectRejected(sendRequest(\"/v1/messages\", R\"({\"model\":\"claude\",\"messages\":[]})\"));"," }"," ","+// The same route carries the provider's other endpoints, which are left alone.","+TEST_P(SchemaValidationIntegrationTest, UnconfiguredRouteForwardsAnotherEndpoint) {","+  initializeFilters(/*with_filter_state=*/false, /*fail_open=*/false, /*declare_route=*/false);","+  const std::string payload =","+      R\"({\"model\":\"claude\",\"system\":\"be terse\",\"messages\":[{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"hi\"}]})\";","+  expectForwarded(sendRequest(\"/v1/messages/count_tokens\", payload), payload);","+  test_server_->waitForCounter(\"ai_protocol_manager.schema_validation.skipped\", testing::Eq(1));","+  EXPECT_EQ(","+      test_server_->counter(\"ai_protocol_manager.schema_validation.llm_protocol_detected\")->value(),","+      0);","+}","+"," // set_filter_state builds the core's filter state object from its enum-value name. The payload is"," // valid Chat Completions, as the path would have detected, so only Anthropic rejects it."," TEST_P(SchemaValidationIntegrationTest, FilterStateNamesTheApi) {",""],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":219,"deletions":55,"truncated":false,"file_count":9},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-27T19:03:51.815784+00:00"}